# BAT security chief who lost his badge. Flags: landry_asked, badge_returned. Clears door flag bat_badge (hq_bat lobby).
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('badge_returned')
goto: Returned

cond: HasItem('bat_badge')
goto: HaveBadge

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (He pats his jacket pocket for the third time.)
+ You see a badge? BAT, my photo, security clearance. Lost it somewhere on this street an hour ago.
effect: SetFlag('landry_asked')
#
o_text: What is it worth to you?
o_id: landry_worth
o_goto: Worth
#
o_text: Anyone bump into you?
o_id: landry_who
o_goto: Who
#
o_text: Haven't seen it.
o_id: landry_leave
o_goto: End

name: Worth
npc: A hundred sat and a friend in BAT security. Those are rarer than the money.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: worth_back
o_goto: Default

name: Who
npc: A tout. Lottery slips, big smile, hands everywhere. Benny, they call him. He is still on the corner, laughing.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: who_back
o_goto: Default

name: HaveBadge
npc: That is my badge. Hand it over and we are square.
#
o_text: Here. Found it on a tout.
o_id: landry_return
o_goto: Return
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: landry_keep
o_goto: End

name: Return
npc: (He clips it on like a man putting his name back.)
+ Hundred sat, as said. And the lobby door at BAT opens for you now. Tell the desk Landry sent you.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'bat_badge')
effect: PlayerAddGold(100)
effect: SetFlag('badge_returned')
effect: ClearFlag('bat_badge')
#
o_text: I'll remember.
o_id: landry_done
o_goto: End

name: Returned
npc: My badge is on my chest and my debt is paid. You still get through the lobby.
#
o_text: Good.
o_id: landry_returned_leave
o_goto: End

name: End
npc: (He goes back to watching the street.)
effect: EndConversation
